{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dfdcf34871644d15592c9ba9a6a89079b1775a8185e88f4aadf17b7411f5dd07", "ja": "大反響の2人の動画は企画で1位を獲得。\n『オフィウクス』の仕事も急増する。\n疲れて仮眠を取るプロデューサーを見つけた\n紬と歌織は、改めて感謝するとともに、\nその寝顔をこっそり写真に収めるのだった。", "zh": "引发巨大反响的2人视频在企划中斩获了第1名。\n“蛇夫座”的工作也随之激增。\n发现了因疲倦而小憩的制作人，\n紬与歌织在再次表达感谢的同时，\n悄悄地将那张睡脸拍了下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4c60a7005eba700ebb13221338bd747f1f98801c647dc2a69070bd3b01f2ff08", "ja": "（歌織さんと紬のドライブ動画はバズりにバズって\n『＃バズしか見えないっ！』企画で1位を獲得した！）", "zh": "（歌织小姐和紬的驾车视频火了又火，在“#只能看见爆红了！”企划中获得了第1名！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "15d49924534cbfaaac7f692f6886489438b36f8dae3ddaa69032f8b55cec9baa", "ja": "（それに伴い、関連の撮影、取材。TVCM撮影の\n準備と、各種メディア展開用の写真も選ばないと……）", "zh": "（除此之外，还有相关的拍摄、采访。还得准备电视广告的拍摄，\n也要挑选用于各种媒体宣传的照片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "12efed4df6c751116ea6688cae17abe4c0b95df153021793b642bd295a35a31f", "ja": "（あと、明日は番組ゲスト出演もあるか……ふう。\n10分……10分だけ仮眠だけさせてもらおう……）", "zh": "（另外，明天还要作为节目嘉宾出演吗……呼。就让我先小睡10分钟……不，10分钟吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "814632d4b6c2b17da7eed1853a80929ef0eeacbf67c0084434d0b7c6b3827290", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どこに行ったのかしら？\nもしかして……あっ、やっぱり。", "zh": "{$P$}先生去哪里了呢？\n该不会……啊，果然在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6debafa14bd378a14c3bfc3ecb3cdde38be00543e31f4aff7ec2fab97dfa7568", "ja": "（すやすや……）", "zh": "（呼呼大睡……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "32b7ec0dcbff42c10e1686635af90c84d8640ebce66a181b589fa1c137df346a", "ja": "仮眠中でしたか。もうすぐ打ち合わせだというのに\nぐっすりと……神経の太い方ですね。", "zh": "是在午睡吗？明明马上就要开会了，却还睡得这么熟……您可真是心大呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "7a6ce74388f521d2b3f4c4094f24aa2ea70f4eb5d60844239b2b7d7e49c32af8", "ja": "そうね……でも、ここのところずっと忙しそうだし。\nすこしは休めていればいいんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊……不过，最近一直都很忙的样子。要是能稍微休息一下就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "96d24f8b1c325d3998ad705dd411f2df5069e39a1658afdedb558c73e7457ae0", "ja": "SNSのお仕事も、金沢でのお仕事も。\n想定以上の量になってしまったし……。", "zh": "社交平台的工作也是，金泽的工作也是。\n工作量都超出了预期……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "2c639d768cd28c024afaf96057299df3119f0c8879480579345996d118017328", "ja": "それもこれも全部、私たちのためですもの。\n隙間時間に、お昼寝くらいさせてあげたいわ。", "zh": "这一切也全都是为了我们嘛。\n至少让我在空闲时间里睡个午觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "da3e3b7596912796356dd467b3980d4d2259abf4c63d4c1cee486df7782f1ed4", "ja": "そう……ですね。\n私も、感謝はしていないわけではありません。", "zh": "是……呢。\n我也不是不感激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "68a41d3f2d240af6676221cdc26b996e0ab97c1a10da0f36c91e4d32c7b67f6c", "ja": "このように大きな結果が得られたのも、\n{$P$}のおかげですから。", "zh": "能取得如此巨大的成果，也是多亏了{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "b316b347c0fcaa9e98d51a08aa38931da252fa0ec10d7dfb093c1a9047612c62", "ja": "ふふっ。紬ちゃん、{$P$}さんに\nそういう言葉、もっと伝えてあげたらいいのに。", "zh": "呵呵，紬，要是能多跟{$P$}先生说说那样的话就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cbb0f422e5ed4ba32620a3fa8b4050995837089f351fe272fa53c7fd14265d9a", "ja": "えっ！？　……あ、あの。\n{$P$}、寝ていますよね……？", "zh": "诶！？……那、那个。\n{$P$}，睡着了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4c60b6ec764ea974244d20b3ff9c366943b57a2d6451425bb2a6f9dbce98abfc", "ja": "まさか寝たふりをしていて、\nこっそり私たちの会話を聞いていたり、などは……。", "zh": "难道其实是在装睡，\n偷偷听着我们的对话，之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "f74800f2475fc96507a562eff379d2c13c9e29511ed4755e6fd5e3fed854fc1b", "ja": "いいえ、本当にぐっすりよ。それにしても……\nふふっ、幸せそうな寝顔……♪", "zh": "没有啦，是真的睡得很香哦。不过话说回来……\n呵呵，睡脸看起来好幸福呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "5f37d1048424531d6890d72cfb5457f79833b115fda7f75814e420e25e1dd51b", "ja": "そうだ！　ねえ、紬ちゃん。\nごにょごにょ……。", "zh": "对了！那个，紬。\n（小声）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c3e762ddce3829ec8a72bf5973d9cd1ae5e238dd48d45cfe38b48a7eb1b0a68a", "ja": "えっ。{$P$}の寝顔を……？\nそ、それはさすがに……。", "zh": "咦。要把{$P$}的睡脸……？\n这、这未免也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "28a242ebd3cd6cf5cdc6be23ed5e0dec11c987715fa167c9c01be7ef41041c49", "ja": "ダメかしら？　あんまり幸せそうだし、\nいつでも見返せたらいいなって……。", "zh": "不行吗？因为看起来实在太幸福了，\n要是能随时拿出来看看就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "26a05607826939a478f65cc04318bc95010f036aaca057e920eed69b845a9240", "ja": "それとも、{$P$}さんも、\nさすがに寝顔は恥ずかしいって言うかしら……？", "zh": "还是说，连{$P$}先生也会觉得，自己的睡脸实在有些难为情呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0a67f2841bff8ebeb44ca41682ee61feb16b1149139a17e48e38ec70222d1073", "ja": "……いえ、思い返せば私も恥ずかしい思いをして\nいましたね。あのドライブ動画で。", "zh": "……不，回想起来，我也曾经经历过很羞耻的事呢。就是那段兜风视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8f44f6485467deadce10a265ec1cb51e3e8f5ea5b2a12a1a10a3e80376aec3d7", "ja": "あの時の分ということで……{$P$}\nにも、恥をかいていただきましょう。", "zh": "就当是抵消那时的份……也要让{$P$}\n丢一丢脸才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "b7af2975384c792f163a9935a645a7d41166d5a7d8ffa2635b1e29ce87d26753", "ja": "それじゃ、こっそり……。", "zh": "那就悄悄地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1022_null", "source_sha256": "698b103c0b242027be811d84f7c9d8e4c7e53969a2b91be417f436df22249145", "ja": "パシャ！　パシャ！", "zh": "咔嚓！咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "328a66f153910044575283d4d907175b7d064ab76f106cf206fb3fea47c212bd", "ja": "この写真は、\nふたりだけの秘密にしておきましょうね♪", "zh": "这张照片，就作为只属于我们两个人的秘密吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fadd2dc9b42436c6fed6bd54083dca41b1fa0942760acdbedf83fe24b3f31008", "ja": "はい。この写真は、SNSに\n投稿するわけにはいきませんから。", "zh": "是的。这张照片可不能发到社交平台上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0c5c2e368b56d6860d8e96a566ab1a1d7df9532b48ac3a513204663288f6cb79", "ja": "う～ん……。\n……むにゃむにゃ……。", "zh": "嗯……。\n……呼呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "5af7e5eacc339989627d2c6cc79556421780549a268d16fc70156dc89d886a43", "ja": "{$P$}さんを起こしてしまうと\nいけないから、外に行きましょうか？", "zh": "吵醒{$P$}先生就不好了，\n我们去外面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "17565ebe00f1084d245e1444c5607e4db90abb7f9bc4eac0066ea331759b9e63", "ja": "でしたら、甘味処はいかがですか？\n先日の件を、試してみたいのです。", "zh": "既然如此，去甜品店怎么样？\n我想试试前几天那件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "095675c2a6cefd4f4e9dfa043e96fa7f837eae01c65c0edea7d381efc2c07406", "ja": "うふふ、いいわね。\n行きましょうか！", "zh": "呵呵，好呀。\n我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
