{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "eef62df8c6b52909ee005f79fe637decadbdd8d684d8fd64e44f221fa7519da3", "ja": "（……あのふたりなら、バズに留まらない……\nもっと、大きな流行を……必ず……むにゃ……）", "zh": "（……那两个人的话，肯定不会只停留在走红……一定会掀起更大的潮流……呼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
